WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:04.000
video file & English subtitles: Safex

00:00:08.642 --> 00:00:14.747
Stear and the others celebrated
as Candy passed the test.

00:00:16.616 --> 00:00:20.650
Candy had a wonderful time
and returned to the hospital.

00:00:22.088 --> 00:00:27.526
Mr. Albert had left the hospital
and left a message.

00:00:31.097 --> 00:00:32.064
Mr. Albert.

00:00:32.966 --> 00:00:38.427
The vanished Mr. Albert.

00:00:39.272 --> 00:00:41.502
Mr. Albert is missing!

00:00:41.808 --> 00:00:43.710
Thank you, Candy.

00:00:43.910 --> 00:00:50.181
I will never forget you.

00:00:52.352 --> 00:00:54.252
Mr. Albert!

00:00:59.960 --> 00:01:02.451
Mr. Albert, where are you?

00:01:12.205 --> 00:01:15.834
Mr. Albert said before...

00:01:16.610 --> 00:01:20.671
It's better to ignore a hopeless patient.

00:01:23.083 --> 00:01:26.814
Let me die here.

00:01:27.821 --> 00:01:32.383
Die here...

00:01:34.828 --> 00:01:38.457
Mr. Albert!

00:01:43.136 --> 00:01:45.166
Mr. Albert!

00:01:47.107 --> 00:01:49.070
No sign of him in the hospital.

00:01:49.270 --> 00:01:50.937
He must have gone outside.

00:01:51.144 --> 00:01:54.314
I came right back after I finished
with Stear and the others.

00:01:54.514 --> 00:01:56.382
He wouldn't go too far.

00:02:11.565 --> 00:02:15.399
It's dark and cold now.

00:02:15.769 --> 00:02:17.637
Where is Mr. Albert?

00:02:17.837 --> 00:02:19.602
I need to find him.

00:02:19.806 --> 00:02:22.007
Yeah, I will ask Stear to help!

00:02:40.160 --> 00:02:44.264
Hey boy, keep your eyes on he road!

00:02:44.464 --> 00:02:45.782
Candy!

00:02:45.982 --> 00:02:47.067
Stear!

00:02:47.267 --> 00:02:48.828
Why did you hit me?

00:02:49.102 --> 00:02:51.564
This carriage came out of nowhere.

00:02:52.405 --> 00:02:56.005
Neil, no more driving in the future,
you can't drive.

00:02:56.977 --> 00:02:59.775
Who wants to drive
this piece of metal anyway!

00:03:00.213 --> 00:03:01.448
Ouch!

00:03:01.748 --> 00:03:03.450
Hopeless.

00:03:03.650 --> 00:03:04.539
True.

00:03:05.051 --> 00:03:08.983
Candy, look, my new invention,
a camping van!

00:03:09.183 --> 00:03:12.474
Why did you come back?
You forgot something?

00:03:12.674 --> 00:03:14.820
No. Mr. Albert is gone!

00:03:16.329 --> 00:03:18.129
Help me find him!

00:03:26.473 --> 00:03:28.375
Mr. Albert was so impulsive!

00:03:28.575 --> 00:03:30.875
He left the hospital
without knowing his past.

00:03:31.411 --> 00:03:34.179
Mr. Albert was recovering well.

00:03:34.379 --> 00:03:37.010
So I left him by himself.

00:03:37.317 --> 00:03:39.381
I should have stayed by his side.

00:03:39.920 --> 00:03:43.822
We asked you out,
we are responsible for this too.

00:03:44.372 --> 00:03:46.725
Stear, stop there.

00:03:51.998 --> 00:03:53.400
Where is Mr. Albert?

00:03:53.800 --> 00:03:55.268
Where is he?

00:03:55.468 --> 00:04:00.074
No, we should split
and look for Mr. Albert separately.

00:04:00.874 --> 00:04:03.072
That makes sense, we should split.

00:04:03.843 --> 00:04:06.379
Right! Brother,
take me to the train station!

00:04:06.579 --> 00:04:08.970
I will stop Mr. Albert
from taking the train.

00:04:09.482 --> 00:04:11.815
I will look around the alleys.

00:04:12.519 --> 00:04:14.921
I will drive around.

00:04:15.121 --> 00:04:17.854
Candy. I will meet you
at the hospital's entrance in two hours.

00:04:18.959 --> 00:04:21.723
- Let's go!
- Please.

00:04:25.231 --> 00:04:29.634
What's the big deal about a wife...

00:04:35.608 --> 00:04:37.576
The old Mr. Albert,

00:04:37.777 --> 00:04:40.575
I wouldn't worry about him
no matter where he went.

00:04:54.728 --> 00:04:56.229
Even if we should part,

00:04:56.429 --> 00:04:59.298
I still believed we would meet again.

00:05:08.541 --> 00:05:10.243
But not now.

00:05:10.443 --> 00:05:13.413
I need to stay by his side
until he remembers the past.

00:05:13.613 --> 00:05:14.648
Mr. Albert,

00:05:15.048 --> 00:05:19.352
where are you in this complicated city?

00:05:19.552 --> 00:05:22.558
Why didn't I think about this earlier?
He must be there!

00:05:24.190 --> 00:05:27.427
Mr. Albert must be in his favourite spot.

00:05:27.627 --> 00:05:30.030
In the peaceful green land,

00:05:30.230 --> 00:05:32.621
close to a small lake.

00:05:34.000 --> 00:05:37.397
Mr. Albert must be there!

00:06:14.140 --> 00:06:15.630
Candy,

00:06:17.844 --> 00:06:19.709
you are a kind nurse.

00:06:21.514 --> 00:06:23.884
Is my name really Albert?

00:06:24.384 --> 00:06:29.003
Sorry, Albert is my brother's name

00:06:29.956 --> 00:06:32.425
You look like my brother.

00:06:32.625 --> 00:06:37.292
Besides, it would be hard
to call you without a name.

00:06:39.199 --> 00:06:40.467
You don't like it?

00:06:40.667 --> 00:06:44.298
It's alright,
but that's your brother's name.

00:06:45.905 --> 00:06:48.772
But my name...

00:06:49.442 --> 00:06:51.239
My name...

00:06:51.644 --> 00:06:54.738
No, I can't remember it!

00:06:55.648 --> 00:06:57.450
Don't force yourself.

00:06:57.650 --> 00:07:00.520
You will remember when you recover.

00:07:00.720 --> 00:07:03.082
You will remember your name then.

00:07:05.225 --> 00:07:09.093
Don't underestimate me, I am
a well known nurse in this hospital.

00:07:18.371 --> 00:07:21.272
You were just a trainee.

00:07:21.574 --> 00:07:22.575
And...

00:07:22.775 --> 00:07:26.072
I am a well known nurse
in this hospital.

00:07:26.679 --> 00:07:27.976
And...

00:07:31.050 --> 00:07:35.350
Mr. Albert, look!
I passed the test!

00:07:35.855 --> 00:07:36.986
Look!

00:07:40.059 --> 00:07:41.617
Congratulations, Candy!

00:07:42.529 --> 00:07:44.464
Thank you!

00:07:44.664 --> 00:07:50.025
From now on
I can take care of Mr. Albert.

00:07:52.472 --> 00:07:53.973
Thank you, Candy.

00:07:54.173 --> 00:07:57.243
But I can't cause you
any more trouble.

00:07:57.443 --> 00:07:59.605
I will give you back the name Albert.

00:08:01.414 --> 00:08:04.144
My memory is lost.

00:08:04.350 --> 00:08:06.409
I have no future and no hope.

00:08:09.522 --> 00:08:14.208
Losing my past is like losing myself.

00:08:14.408 --> 00:08:17.130
How was I brought up?
How did I grow up?

00:08:17.330 --> 00:08:20.300
To have a present,
I need to have a past.

00:08:20.500 --> 00:08:23.494
So that I can decide my future.

00:08:23.703 --> 00:08:26.573
But I know nothing about my past.

00:08:26.873 --> 00:08:29.965
What should I do now?
What should I do in the future?

00:08:30.310 --> 00:08:33.541
Who am I? How should I live?

00:08:38.751 --> 00:08:41.420
It's getting darker, I need to hurry.

00:08:44.591 --> 00:08:45.892
Candy.

00:08:46.092 --> 00:08:49.621
I am not you family,
I can't rely on you.

00:08:49.929 --> 00:08:51.631
The memory I lost.

00:08:51.831 --> 00:08:54.000
I will take it back
with my own hands.

00:08:54.400 --> 00:08:58.018
Poope, I will search for my lost memory.

00:08:58.218 --> 00:09:00.001
Are you coming with me?

00:09:00.940 --> 00:09:02.407
Poope, let's go.

00:09:19.092 --> 00:09:21.356
Mr. Albert!

00:09:23.429 --> 00:09:26.296
Mr. Albert!

00:09:27.767 --> 00:09:31.731
Mr. Albert!

00:09:35.141 --> 00:09:37.575
Mr. Albert!

00:09:54.260 --> 00:09:56.490
Mr. Albert!

00:10:00.033 --> 00:10:02.763
Mr. Albert!

00:10:03.603 --> 00:10:05.032
Candy?

00:10:06.873 --> 00:10:09.037
Mr. Albert!

00:10:09.809 --> 00:10:12.903
Mr. Albert!

00:10:15.048 --> 00:10:16.777
He is not here.

00:10:17.550 --> 00:10:19.575
Where exactly is Mr. Albert.?

00:10:21.020 --> 00:10:25.252
I thought he would be here.

00:10:25.558 --> 00:10:28.288
Mr. Albert, where are you?

00:10:33.666 --> 00:10:35.268
Mr. Albert, you fool!

00:10:35.468 --> 00:10:40.406
I am so worried about you!

00:10:40.606 --> 00:10:42.474
Where are you?

00:10:49.482 --> 00:10:52.508
Why would Candy come here
looking for me?

00:10:52.819 --> 00:10:54.912
We are not related...

00:10:57.790 --> 00:10:59.417
This voice...

00:10:59.659 --> 00:11:02.787
Mr. Albert!

00:11:04.197 --> 00:11:05.832
Candy, you...

00:11:06.032 --> 00:11:07.524
Mr. Albert!

00:11:07.734 --> 00:11:11.804
You fool, why did you leave?

00:11:12.004 --> 00:11:13.599
Why?

00:11:15.608 --> 00:11:19.066
I have looked everywhere for you!

00:11:20.580 --> 00:11:22.548
How did you know I was here?

00:11:22.915 --> 00:11:25.509
Candy, leave me alone.

00:11:25.785 --> 00:11:28.555
We are just strangers,
I can't cause you any more trouble.

00:11:28.955 --> 00:11:30.690
You are wrong.

00:11:30.890 --> 00:11:33.789
I knew you, that's why I came here.

00:11:34.360 --> 00:11:35.622
Candy...

00:11:35.895 --> 00:11:37.892
You love the nature.

00:11:38.092 --> 00:11:39.827
You used to go to places like this.

00:11:40.066 --> 00:11:44.400
The forest from Lakewood,
the zoo in London and Africa.

00:11:44.837 --> 00:11:46.634
We know each other for a long time.

00:12:05.425 --> 00:12:08.155
The first time we met...

00:12:09.429 --> 00:12:12.262
...I had fallen from the waterfall.

00:12:14.634 --> 00:12:16.295
Help!

00:12:19.672 --> 00:12:22.270
Somebody help me!

00:12:55.775 --> 00:12:57.242
It's her?

00:13:09.188 --> 00:13:13.056
You saved my life.

00:13:14.660 --> 00:13:16.963
And whenever I felt upset,

00:13:17.163 --> 00:13:20.430
you always showed up and encouraged me.

00:13:22.034 --> 00:13:25.561
I want to hold your hand, Anthony!

00:13:40.520 --> 00:13:42.388
Mr. Albert...

00:13:42.588 --> 00:13:44.353
Why are you so sad?

00:13:44.790 --> 00:13:46.758
Where is the Candy I knew?

00:13:47.159 --> 00:13:48.683
Anthony...

00:13:49.028 --> 00:13:51.656
Anthony is dead!

00:13:58.437 --> 00:14:00.918
You liked him, don't you?

00:14:01.118 --> 00:14:05.645
We fell in love
from the very first moment.

00:14:05.845 --> 00:14:07.610
He was so kind to me.

00:14:08.214 --> 00:14:12.878
He loved you, cared for you.

00:14:14.120 --> 00:14:19.325
Yes, that's why...
I can't forget about him!

00:14:19.525 --> 00:14:22.328
Candy, do you have any plans
for the future?

00:14:22.528 --> 00:14:24.764
The things you told me,

00:14:24.964 --> 00:14:27.332
I will return them to you now.

00:14:27.667 --> 00:14:30.761
If I am the Albert
you were talking about...

00:14:31.370 --> 00:14:33.361
Am I any different now?

00:14:35.908 --> 00:14:39.345
I have no name, no address and no job.

00:14:39.545 --> 00:14:42.849
Come and gone.

00:14:43.049 --> 00:14:44.951
Maybe I am just a wanderer.

00:14:45.151 --> 00:14:47.818
I could even be an escapee.

00:14:48.220 --> 00:14:52.258
How is that possible?
I know you are a good man!

00:14:52.858 --> 00:14:54.627
What do you know about me?

00:14:54.827 --> 00:14:58.959
Candy, you have no idea
what is my background and occupation.

00:14:59.398 --> 00:15:01.634
So?

00:15:01.834 --> 00:15:06.472
As long as you are bright,
brave and kind,

00:15:06.672 --> 00:15:08.699
that's enough.

00:15:10.343 --> 00:15:12.578
Is that really me?

00:15:12.778 --> 00:15:14.646
I can't remember a bit.

00:15:15.715 --> 00:15:18.117
You will.

00:15:18.317 --> 00:15:21.721
Please don't look at the bad side,
live on bravely.

00:15:21.921 --> 00:15:23.556
I will take care of you
before until you remember everything.

00:15:23.756 --> 00:15:25.123
No.

00:15:26.726 --> 00:15:28.717
Go back to the hospital.

00:15:29.128 --> 00:15:30.763
I have recovered.

00:15:30.963 --> 00:15:32.398
I have no reasons to stay there.

00:15:32.598 --> 00:15:33.866
Good bye, Candy.

00:15:34.066 --> 00:15:35.433
Leave me alone.

00:15:36.535 --> 00:15:38.032
Mr. Albert...

00:15:40.239 --> 00:15:41.741
Mr. Albert!

00:15:41.941 --> 00:15:43.910
I will live on.

00:15:44.110 --> 00:15:46.178
Thank you for everything.

00:15:46.379 --> 00:15:47.613
Don't go.

00:15:47.913 --> 00:15:50.939
I will come back to you
if I remember my past.

00:15:51.951 --> 00:15:54.511
Please don't leave me!

00:15:55.421 --> 00:15:56.889
Mr. Albert!

00:15:57.389 --> 00:15:59.225
You saved me from the waterfall.

00:15:59.425 --> 00:16:03.557
You encouraged me when Anthony died.

00:16:03.863 --> 00:16:05.464
And when Terry left me.

00:16:05.664 --> 00:16:08.124
Back then, I came to you for comfort.

00:16:08.668 --> 00:16:10.970
This time I will help you!

00:16:11.270 --> 00:16:12.837
Candy...

00:16:13.372 --> 00:16:14.835
Please let me take care of you!

00:16:15.035 --> 00:16:17.308
You were always there for me.

00:16:17.508 --> 00:16:19.340
I want to repay you.

00:16:22.081 --> 00:16:25.251
I lied to you that I had a brother.

00:16:25.451 --> 00:16:27.449
Actually I don't have parents.

00:16:27.649 --> 00:16:32.114
So, I always see you as my brother.

00:16:32.525 --> 00:16:34.390
My real brother.

00:16:36.062 --> 00:16:39.365
I feel safe
as long as you are with me.

00:16:39.565 --> 00:16:41.634
We are like family.

00:16:41.834 --> 00:16:43.565
Candy, thank you.

00:16:44.403 --> 00:16:45.961
Thank you, Candy.

00:16:46.405 --> 00:16:48.605
Mr. Albert....

00:16:48.805 --> 00:16:52.576
I will take good care of you.

00:16:53.176 --> 00:16:55.114
Having her around

00:16:55.314 --> 00:16:58.881
makes me feel relaxed.

00:16:59.081 --> 00:17:01.110
I should stay with her
for the time being.

00:17:20.740 --> 00:17:23.609
Candy is so slow,
it has been three hours.

00:17:23.809 --> 00:17:25.108
Brother!

00:17:27.913 --> 00:17:28.981
It's Candy!

00:17:29.181 --> 00:17:31.049
She found Mr. Albert!

00:17:31.283 --> 00:17:33.114
Stear! Archie!

00:17:34.220 --> 00:17:35.744
Great, Candy!

00:17:37.890 --> 00:17:40.059
Candy told me about you guys.

00:17:40.259 --> 00:17:42.024
Sorry to keep you all so much time.

00:17:42.361 --> 00:17:44.022
Never mind.

00:17:44.263 --> 00:17:46.932
Mr. Albert, we want to ask you a favour.

00:17:47.132 --> 00:17:49.428
Don't make Candy sad again.

00:17:50.970 --> 00:17:53.534
All's well when ends well.

00:18:00.446 --> 00:18:02.573
We are home, Poope.

00:18:05.451 --> 00:18:06.675
What is going on?

00:18:12.758 --> 00:18:15.522
Since when this ward became a store room?

00:18:15.728 --> 00:18:18.891
I remember the doctor on duty tonight
is doctor Leonard.

00:18:19.198 --> 00:18:20.261
Right.

00:18:20.461 --> 00:18:21.865
Candy, it's my fault.

00:18:22.101 --> 00:18:23.834
Why is that, Mr. Albert?

00:18:24.034 --> 00:18:27.606
I told doctor Leonard.
when I left the hospital.

00:18:27.806 --> 00:18:30.176
He thought I wouldn't be back.

00:18:30.376 --> 00:18:33.746
But it's so mean to change this ward
in to a store room right away!

00:18:33.946 --> 00:18:36.508
I wasn't told about this.

00:18:38.117 --> 00:18:39.448
Candy!

00:18:42.221 --> 00:18:44.890
Excuse me, is doctor Leonard here?

00:18:45.090 --> 00:18:46.958
Why? Something happened?

00:18:47.359 --> 00:18:50.988
No, I come to speak to him
about ward No. 0.

00:18:51.597 --> 00:18:53.087
He is inside.

00:18:57.970 --> 00:19:01.806
Didn't you know
that the patient asked to be discharged?

00:19:02.208 --> 00:19:04.333
I wouldn't let him leave.

00:19:04.944 --> 00:19:08.026
You were responsible
to look after him, why didn't you know?

00:19:08.226 --> 00:19:10.082
What were you doing?

00:19:10.582 --> 00:19:14.452
Because, it was my day off,
I didn't know...

00:19:14.952 --> 00:19:16.550
Forget it,
I don't want to know the reasons.

00:19:17.050 --> 00:19:19.458
Candice, I want to make this clear,

00:19:19.658 --> 00:19:23.129
That man can't stay
in this hospital any longer.

00:19:23.629 --> 00:19:24.697
Why?

00:19:24.897 --> 00:19:28.462
He can recover
without staying in the hospital.

00:19:28.962 --> 00:19:30.536
But his memory...

00:19:30.736 --> 00:19:33.272
You think he can regain his memory?

00:19:33.472 --> 00:19:36.258
We have done our best.

00:19:36.458 --> 00:19:39.605
We have no obligation
to look after him.

00:19:39.879 --> 00:19:43.147
But headmistress Mary Jane said...

00:19:43.347 --> 00:19:46.852
Caring is the best cure
for regaining memory.

00:19:47.052 --> 00:19:49.221
Take good care of him.

00:19:49.421 --> 00:19:52.258
Candice, I am not against you
taking care of him.

00:19:52.458 --> 00:19:55.459
But we can’t let him stay for free.

00:19:57.229 --> 00:19:59.288
Candy, did it work out?

00:20:00.833 --> 00:20:03.503
I didn't know
he was such an unreasonable man.

00:20:04.003 --> 00:20:05.671
Thank you, Candy.

00:20:05.871 --> 00:20:07.830
I appreciate your help.

00:20:08.240 --> 00:20:09.408
Mr. Albert...

00:20:09.608 --> 00:20:12.444
It's alright, I could sleep anywhere.

00:20:12.644 --> 00:20:14.678
I am used to it, right?

00:20:16.615 --> 00:20:20.186
Yes, you can sleep in my van.

00:20:20.386 --> 00:20:21.548
That's right.

00:20:35.768 --> 00:20:36.969
I'm so tired today!

00:20:37.169 --> 00:20:38.832
Have a good rest.

00:20:40.205 --> 00:20:42.298
Thank you, Candy.

00:20:42.908 --> 00:20:46.338
Mr. Albert, don't try to run away again.

00:20:49.548 --> 00:20:51.717
Good night, Mr. Albert.

00:20:51.917 --> 00:20:53.546
Good night, Candy.

00:20:56.822 --> 00:20:57.880
- He is asleep?
- Yes.

00:21:00.159 --> 00:21:01.592
It's so quiet...

00:21:05.965 --> 00:21:07.933
Having Candy by his side,

00:21:08.534 --> 00:21:12.170
it definitely won't take long
to regain his memory,

00:21:13.405 --> 00:21:17.705
Mr. Albert told himself.
